@title Critic audit regressions (defects.md round 1 and 2)
@area Regressions
# Each check states the FIXED behaviour; a finding means the defect is still there.
# Ids are those in audit/critic/defects.md. Visual-only defects (C-02, C-04, C-06, C-12) have a picture, no assertion.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
# C-03: a freshly opened file starts with an empty undo history.
expect_disabled Undo
# C-02: zoom to fit centres the sheet (look at the picture).
key Home
wait 10
shot c02-zoom-to-fit
# C-08: menu entries with nothing to act on are disabled.
click_text Edit #1
wait 6
expect_disabled Paste
key Escape
click_text Draw #1
wait 6
expect_disabled "Accept proposal"
expect_disabled "Accept all proposals"
key Escape
# C-01: Escape closes a floating window.
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Standards check
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
shot c01-standards-open
key Escape
wait 6
shot c01-after-escape
expect_not "Standards check"
# C-04, C-07: cabinet problem pill and clipped toolbar.
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
shot c04-cabinet-pill
check_layout
# C-06: commissioning list.
click_text Commissioning
wait 20
shot c06-commissioning
